From 9c14570a41fe1d73092db0eb42d05e87cba64011 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: NeoTech <andreas@roughedge.se>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 07:45:14 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] fix(verify): a model that is only the stock's source is
 not judged as the part

A casting copied into a FromModel stock and left in the tree was read
by the program verdict as the finished part, so every cut into it was
a gouge. stock_source::stock_only_model names the one model that is
the source of every program setup's stock, named by no operation,
while an operation names a separate part; part_facets_as_modelled and
parts_facets_in leave it out. Every other document keeps today's
verdict. Rule and dropped readings in
docs/decisions/1094-stock-source-not-part.md.

Fixes #1094

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
